      "text": "[7:15PM] #Igando #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic from Isheri Roundabout inward Igando remains good at the moment.\nMovement from Igando to Akesan is slightly slow due to ongoing commercial activities, but officers are on ground managing the situation effectively.\nFrom Akesan inward Iyana Iba, traffic is moving as expected. The return journey from Iyana Iba back to Igando is also calm and steady.\nTraffic from Igando through Old Garage to Ikotun is good, and movement from Ikotun to Council is smooth as well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
