      "text": "[7:27PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Agbara Custom Point through Jida Junction to Morogbo inward Badagry is slightly busy, mainly due to evening rush and market activities along the corridor.\nTraffic from Morogbo to Okoafo is moving smoothly in both directions. The stretch from Okoafo to Badagry Roundabout is also experiencing good movement.\nTraffic along the Roundabout through Seme-Gbaji Road is good both inward and outward.\nMovement within Badagry town and Ajara axis, in both directions, is good.\nThe return journey from Badagry Roundabout back to Agbara Custom Check Point is also moving steadily.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
