      "text": "[7:33PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nOldAbeokuta Motor Road from Abattoir through Total Under Bridge en route Isokoko to National is good.\nTraffic from Oke Koto inward Oniwaya up to Capitol Road is moving well.\nMagoro Ashade inward Akanni Doherty is free-flowing up to Guinness Junction.\nOba Akran axis from Mobil Ashade to Dangote U-turn is in good shape in both directions.\nAcme Road up to Funmec is clear and movement from Marketing inward Odo Eran is equally smooth.\nOba Ogunji Road from Odo Eran to Pen Cinema is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
