      "text": "[7:46PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Adekunle inward Unilag Waterfront down to Ilaje and onward to Iyana Oworo is smooth, with the return journey from Iyana Oworo back to Adekunle also good.\nAlong the IyanaOworo inw Olopomeji, Gbagada, Olamide Badoo corridor, traffic is steady in both directions with no delays reported.\n\nThere’s a free flow of traffic from Deeper Life to New Garage.\nMovement from Muritala to Bariga Roundabout is smooth, and the stretch from Ilaje Chemist Bus Stop through Pako, Unilag Gate, and Abule Oja. Return journey from Unilag Gate to Baale is also moving well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
